{"seq":3,"slug":"system-architecture","title":"系统架构","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/quantitative-finance/algorithmic-trading/system-architecture","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"trading-system-design","title":"交易系统架构设计","url":"/l-doc-books/h/quantitative-finance/algorithmic-trading/system-architecture/trading-system-design","wordCount":1010,"readingTime":5},{"seq":2,"slug":"backtesting-framework","title":"回测框架与偏差控制","url":"/l-doc-books/h/quantitative-finance/algorithmic-trading/system-architecture/backtesting-framework","wordCount":1004,"readingTime":5},{"seq":3,"slug":"risk-controls","title":"实时风控与熔断机制","url":"/l-doc-books/h/quantitative-finance/algorithmic-trading/system-architecture/risk-controls","wordCount":847,"readingTime":4}],"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"系统架构\">系统架构</h1><p>系统架构是将交易策略从研究环境推向生产运行的关键桥梁。一个专业的算法交易系统需要处理微秒级的市场数据更新、支撑高吞吐量的订单管理、提供严格无偏的回测能力、以及多层次的实时风控防护。本章覆盖三大核心模块：交易系统的整体架构设计涵盖事件驱动引擎、低延迟数据流和订单管理系统；回测框架聚焦于避免前视偏差和过拟合的关键技术；实时风控与熔断机制则提供从单笔订单到系统级别的多层风险防线。</p>\n"}